{
 "source": "geneva",
 "book": "PRO",
 "chapter": 17,
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "geneva/PRO.17.1",
   "range": "PRO.17.1",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "07e39dc4",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PRO.17.1#p1-07e39dc4",
     "text": "For where there were many sacrifices, there were many portions given to the people, with which they feasted.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "sacrifices with strife"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PRO.17.2",
   "range": "PRO.17.2",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "b0c61ba5",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PRO.17.2#p1-b0c61ba5",
     "text": "That is, will be made governor over the children.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "inheritance among the brethren"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PRO.17.8",
   "range": "PRO.17.8",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "a0936e2f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PRO.17.8#p1-a0936e2f",
     "text": "The reward has great force to gain the hearts of men.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "turneth"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PRO.17.9",
   "range": "PRO.17.9",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "3ef62261",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PRO.17.9#p1-3ef62261",
     "text": "He that admonishes the prince of his fault makes him his enemy.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "friends"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PRO.17.11",
   "range": "PRO.17.11",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "b13bea12",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PRO.17.11#p1-b13bea12",
     "text": "By the messenger is meant such means as God uses to punish the rebels.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "messenger shall be sent against him"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PRO.17.12",
   "range": "PRO.17.12",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "b99a842d",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PRO.17.12#p1-b99a842d",
     "text": "By which he means the wicked in his rage, who has no fear of God.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "a fool in his folly"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PRO.17.16",
   "range": "PRO.17.16",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "8bd66f08",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PRO.17.16#p1-8bd66f08",
     "text": "What good does it do the wicked to be rich, seeing he does not set his mind to wisdom?",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "price in the hand of a"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PRO.17.17",
   "range": "PRO.17.17",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "de632df5",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PRO.17.17#p1-de632df5",
     "text": "So that he is more than a friend, even a brother that helps in time of adversity.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "brother is born for adversity"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PRO.17.18",
   "range": "PRO.17.18",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "2f6dbd29",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PRO.17.18#p1-2f6dbd29",
     "text": "Read Pr 6:1.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "striketh hands",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Pr 6:1",
       "ref": "PRO.6.1"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PRO.17.19",
   "range": "PRO.17.19",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "22e40ed4",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PRO.17.19#p1-22e40ed4",
     "text": "Lifts up himself above his degree.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "gate seeketh destruction"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PRO.17.23",
   "range": "PRO.17.23",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "e9e2e2b5",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PRO.17.23#p1-e9e2e2b5",
     "text": "That is, secretly and out of the bosom of the rich.",
     "label": "l",
     "anchor": "bosom to pervert the ways of"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PRO.17.24",
   "range": "PRO.17.24",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "648a1b04",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PRO.17.24#p1-648a1b04",
     "text": "That is, wander to and fro, and seek not after wisdom.",
     "label": "m",
     "anchor": "ends of the earth"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PRO.17.26",
   "range": "PRO.17.26",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "1306d0f8",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PRO.17.26#p1-1306d0f8",
     "text": "For their well doing.",
     "label": "n",
     "anchor": "for equity"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
